 "_note": "Weapon styles. Clips are Mixamo animations retargeted onto the base body (assets/anims, data/anim_sources.json). loco: the clip prefix whose idle / walk / run / strafe / back loops are picked by their measured travel direction. light: the combo (each press chains into the next inside the window); heavy: hold the attack button; special: the second attack (E). Each move: clip, speed (playback), dmg (x Attack Damage), poise (stagger damage), stamina, reach (m: the distance between the two bodies' centres the blow is thrown from - you step in to it while winding up). The swing's active window is measured from the clip (fastest blade-hand motion). Player hits are tuned as a power fantasy: light hits never interrupt your attacks; only heavy hits stagger you. Magic: the staff's light / heavy cast your element's spells ('@light' / '@heavy' -> _elements[element]); X switches element. _awakening: landing / taking hits fill a meter; R when full: damage and attack speed up for 'duration' s and melee hits carry the element (proc_*). Spells: count/spread fan out, chain jumps to more foes, pierce flies through, knockback shoves, lifesteal heals, status = burn / chill / hex.",
